WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.515
Before creation began... Shree Maha Vishnu rested upon Ananta. Whenever dharma fades... He descends.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:19.367
During the cosmic deluge... Matsya guided the sacred ark, preserving the Vedas.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:28.379
As the cosmic ocean was churned... Kurma bore Mount Mandara upon His back to steady creation.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:39.023
Plunging into the cosmic abyss... Varaha lifted Mother Earth upon His tusks, restoring divine light.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:48.879
Bursting from the sacred pillar... Narasimha destroyed tyranny and arrogance, protecting pure devotion.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:59.311
Measuring the cosmos in three strides... Vamana revealed that divine humility surpasses all earthly power.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:08.379
Wielding the axe of righteousness... Parashurama punished corrupt rulers and restored cosmic dharma.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:18.907
Mariyada Purushottama... Sri Rama embodied truth, proving that righteousness always triumphs.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:29.047
Upon sacred Kurukshetra... Bhagavan Sri Krishna revealed the Bhagavad Gita, the eternal light of wisdom.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:39.383
Renouncing worldly desires... Gautama Buddha illuminated the noble path of peace and universal compassion.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:48.499
Riding the divine white steed... Kalki descends to conquer adharma and herald the golden age.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:59.071
Across cosmic cycles... Shree Maha Vishnu protects creation and dharma. Om Namo Narayanaya.

